# Cursor Rules & Agent Harness Directives

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/WORKFLOW.md` as primary authority.

## Non-Negotiable Rules:
1. Empirical Metrics Only: Always cite exit codes, test outputs, and compiler logs.
2. Strict TDD: Write failing test (RED) before writing code (GREEN).
3. Gates Enforcement: Follow `.agents/rules/ecc-harness-gate.md`.
4. Headless Browsers Only: Never launch headed browser windows (`headless: true`).
5. Durable Plans: Multi-step work belongs in `docs/plans/active/`.
